# Production Build Environment Variables
# These are NEXT_PUBLIC_ variables that must be available at build time
# Publishable keys are safe to commit (they're designed to be public)
#
# Runtime environment variables (secrets) are configured in Cloudflare dashboard
# and wrangler.jsonc - those are NOT for NEXT_PUBLIC_ vars

